[{"_id":"mFJkwdzb9IpLC3Ip","name":"帆布 Canvas","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>一平方码中等品质、中等重量的帆布，可用于制作各种物品和衣物。</p>\n<p>帆布按 1 到 12 分级，数字越小，品质越好、重量越重。1 号品质的帆布每平方码重约 1.7 磅，而更轻薄脆弱的 12 号每平方码仅重 0.7 磅。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1.2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"canvas"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-worn-red.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332516,"modifiedTime":1763149017290,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"l1YRv9sdhQPaSQop","name":"鸡 Chicken","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>煎蛋卷和鸡翅的来源。成年鸡平均重 5 到 10 磅。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":8,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"cp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"chicken"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/bones/beak-orange-green.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332505,"modifiedTime":1763149103390,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Pn04ySJYcG06Jc4a","name":"肉桂 Cinnamon","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>取自肉桂树的内层树皮，是一种深受各地厨师喜爱、略显稀有的香料。与糖搭配制成各种点心时，更是深受孩子们喜爱。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"cinnamon"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/materials/powder-red-green-yellow.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332330,"modifiedTime":1763149099418,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"u753EokyA4vjksle","name":"丁香 Cloves","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>一种气味浓烈的香料，深受厨师和酿酒师的珍视，适合为肉类、炖菜、浓郁酱汁、苹果酒和印度香料茶等热饮、面包、奶酪，以及派和水果蛋糕等甜点增添风味。</p>\n<p>丁香是桃金娘科常绿植物丁香树干燥后尚未开放的花蕾，气味浓郁。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":3,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"cloves"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/consumables/food/berries-ration-round-red.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332542,"modifiedTime":1763149089604,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"aXWzDW0huOa0WuIO","name":"铜 Copper","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>铜深受高级造船匠、炼金术士、某些珠宝匠和厨师的青睐。铜通常通过露天开采获得，但当表层矿源枯竭或难以找到时，也会进行地下开采。</p>\n<p>虽然铜可用于制造护甲，但将其与锡混合制成更优良的青铜合金，用于军事需求要合适得多。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"copper"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/metal/ingot-stamped-bronze.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332464,"modifiedTime":1763149086611,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"ZcAgZHJ1hhqbedLF","name":"棉布 Cotton","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>一平方码中等品质、中等重量的棉布，可用于制作各种物品和衣物。</p>\n<p>棉布比帆布轻得多、舒适得多，也更容易加工；不过这种作物相对娇贵，因此价格更高，也可能更难获得。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"cotton"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-worn-green.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332449,"modifiedTime":1763149083946,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"W6pJovmnVyjbk0fA","name":"牛 Cow","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>牛适合拥有大片土地的农夫饲养。它们需要大面积的平坦牧场，因此不如其他牲畜常见。不过牛寿命更长，产奶量也大得多。牛皮还能制成更耐用的皮革，不易开裂，且耐热、耐脏。</p>\n<p>视性别和品种不同，成年牛体重可在 1,000 到 1,800 磅之间。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1400,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"cow"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/consumables/food/short-ribs-cooked-meat-brown.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332382,"modifiedTime":1763149080482,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"CrcfT5jwcJTPTsfQ","name":"面粉 Flour","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>由磨坊主研磨过的谷物，是食物链中的下一环。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"cp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"flour"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/consumables/food/soup-broth-bowl-wooden-yellow.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332228,"modifiedTime":1763149077199,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"VcHmykfFBurKzCO6","name":"姜 Ginger","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>一种取自姜的新鲜或干燥根部的香料，与姜黄和豆蔻同属一科。</p>\n<p>它深受厨师和甜点师重视，也受到孩子和偏爱辛辣口味者的喜爱。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"ginger"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/biological/tentacle-thorned-green.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332356,"modifiedTime":1763149073873,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"pMj0mA1wyEhoO6zP","name":"山羊 Goat","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>山羊对土地有限的农夫和高地居民很有用。它们能有效防止草甸过度生长，同时提供羊奶、奶酪，最终还能提供皮革和肉。</p>\n<p>视品种不同，成年山羊体重可从 45 磅一直到 300 磅。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":175,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"goat"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/bones/hooves-cloven-brown.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332528,"modifiedTime":1763149071069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"HHh7Ihuk8ToxJzQX","name":"黄金 Gold","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>对许多文明而言，黄金是货币之王。它通常比铂金之类更常见，但远不及铁等其他金属普遍，因此在稀有度与化学惰性之间达到了理想的平衡。</p>\n<p>与白银不同，黄金更容易在地表找到。地表开采和地下开采都能带来极其丰厚的利润。淘金热可能、也确实曾带来巨大的幸福与惨痛的悲剧。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"gold"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/metal/ingot-gold.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332278,"modifiedTime":1763149067499,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"V3uxNwciT4Ln7S4k","name":"铁 Iron","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>铁常是金属工匠的主力材料，因其相对丰富且易于获取而备受重视。地表铁可见于坠落的陨石和捕虏岩中，但更常见的是地下开采。不过必须小心保养，否则锈蚀会造成损害。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"iron"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/metal/ingot-stamped-silver.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332343,"modifiedTime":1763149065053,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Gh1JxTlM9aRGNrUH","name":"亚麻布 Linen","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>一平方码中等品质、中等重量的亚麻布，可用于制作各种物品和衣物。</p>\n<p>亚麻布比棉布更耐用，其耐久性和透气性使它在温暖气候中尤其受重视。</p>\n<p>亚麻布也有不同种类：较轻的织法每平方码重 6 盎司起，其余则最高可达 15 盎司。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.6,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"linen"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-worn-blue.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332259,"modifiedTime":1763149062165,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"WCbKUQcahzQQX0pL","name":"役牛 Ox","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>役牛本质上是经过专门训练、年满 5 岁的肉用或乳用牛。这些重载役畜能拉动或承载相当于自身体重甚至更重的负荷，可用于拉车、脱粒、驱动灌溉或磨谷的机械，甚至可供骑乘。对于各行各业的工作者来说，役牛都是极受珍视的牲畜。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":2250,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":15,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"ox"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/bones/horn-simple-grey.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332396,"modifiedTime":1763149058865,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"8SQ7vyE6gevpfJvn","name":"胡椒 Pepper","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>胡椒粒是胡椒藤这种开花藤本植物结出的微小果实（核果）。它因用途广泛而深受厨师珍视；冒险者在需要制造干扰或恶作剧时，也可以将其磨碎应急使用。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"pepper"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/materials/powder-red-green-yellow.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332181,"modifiedTime":1763149056312,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"YJ2pBio6uEg5vhgN","name":"猪 Pig","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>猪适合拥有中等或更大土地的农夫饲养。猪繁殖较快，体格结实，能为有进取心的厨师提供各种烹饪可能，其中最首要的自然是培根。猪皮也可制成较便宜的皮革，但相比羔羊皮或山羊皮更不耐撕裂。猪还是猪油的来源。</p>\n<p>多数猪在屠宰时体重在 250 到 270 磅之间，这样能获得最佳的零售分割肉和适中的脂肪层。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":260,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":3,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"pig"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/consumables/meat/hock-leg-pink-brown.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332432,"modifiedTime":1763149053465,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Eyl9QYZcM9CYIqbA","name":"铂金 Platinum","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>铂金远比黄金稀有。它既可能被视为财富的巅峰，也可能被视为逝去时代的遗物，招来猜疑或嫉妒。</p>\n<p>与黄金不同，铂金几乎完全通过地下开采获得。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":500,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"platinum"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/stone/ore-chunk-grey.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332243,"modifiedTime":1763149050644,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Mrmkw4uaWX6UKpbn","name":"藏红花 Saffron","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>藏红花很可能是世界上最受珍视的原料之一。它之所以如此昂贵，是因为生产过程极为耗费人工。这种香料取自番红花的柱头，约需 80,000 朵番红花才能产出 1 磅藏红花。按重量计算，它比黄金更值钱。它因调味作用和据称的健康益处而深受最有眼光的厨师和药剂师珍视。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":15,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"saffron"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/materials/powder-red-green-yellow.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332292,"modifiedTime":1763149047735,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"eDVTXE3qv28DwvPl","name":"盐 Salt","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>盐既是调味品，也是补给品的防腐剂，尤其在不希望使用酒精或醋时，因此深受厨师和军需官珍视。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"cp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"salt"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/consumables/food/bowl-stew-brown.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332475,"modifiedTime":1763149044904,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"P29EeDJQrJJXOIuK","name":"绵羊 Sheep","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>绵羊对土地有限的农夫和高地居民很有用。它们虽不如山羊灵活，却每年都能剪毛，为人们提供衣物、地毯以及铺床和盖椅的毛毯。绵羊体型也更大，因此屠宰价值更高。</p>\n<p>视品种不同，成年绵羊体重可从 100 磅一直到 350 磅。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":225,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"sheep"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/bones/hooves-cloven-brown.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332306,"modifiedTime":1763149042004,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"jad5oFMDv21mPvJP","name":"丝绸 Silk","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>一平方码中等品质、中等重量的丝绸，可用于制作各种物品和衣物。</p>\n<p>丝绸是常见织物中最精美、最令人向往的一种，也是最轻的。多数丝绸每平方码重 2 到 4 盎司。丝绸越重，品质越高、越耐用，颜色也越不透明。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"silk"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/equipment/back/cloak-hooded-pink.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332489,"modifiedTime":1763149039123,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"9t5X9HG9ou6YMSdJ","name":"银 Silver","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>长期以来，白银因其不易反应的特性以及易于加工成精美装饰品而备受珍视，当然也可用作钱币。</p>\n<p>白银很少以天然块状形式存在，通常与其他物质（如硫或氯）混合于矿石中，或与黄金等形成合金。白银也能在地表找到，但更常见的是地下开采。采银利润丰厚，可能引发淘银热。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"silver"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/commodities/metal/ingot-stamped-silver.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332206,"modifiedTime":1763149036282,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"_id":"WdPAGBRUWYaS0TNQ","name":"小麦 Wheat","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>小麦是面包、啤酒等许多食物的常见原料。在土地开阔平坦、气候温和、农民能安全耕作的地区，这种主粮常常构成人们饮食的基础。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"cp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":""},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"trade","subtype":""},"identifier":"wheat"},"sort":0,"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"aitrans","m":"manual"}},"img":"icons/consumables/grains/sack-oats-glowing-white.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.350","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"5.2.0","createdTime":1725037332421,"modifiedTime":1763149032251,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}}]